---
import "../../styles/global.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="id">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>AI Headquarters — InfoLokerKita AI Company</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

    <style>
      :root {
        --bg-main: #080b11;
        --bg-card: #0f1623;
        --bg-card-subtle: #141d2e;
        --border-color: #1e293b;
        --border-focus: #38bdf8;
        --text-primary: #f8fafc;
        --text-muted: #94a3b8;
        --accent-blue: #38bdf8;
        --accent-green: #22c55e;
        --accent-lime: #ccff00;
        --accent-orange: #ff5a36;
        --accent-amber: #f59e0b;
        --accent-red: #ef4444;
      }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      body {
        font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        background-color: var(--bg-main);
        color: var(--text-primary);
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }

      /* Lock overlay */
      #auth-modal {
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        background: rgba(8, 11, 17, 0.96);
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        z-index: 9999;
        padding: 20px;
      }
      .auth-box {
        background: var(--bg-card);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 32px;
        max-width: 440px;
        width: 100%;
        text-align: center;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
      }
      .auth-box h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--accent-blue); }
      .auth-box p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 18px; }
      .auth-label {
        display: block;
        text-align: left;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }
      .auth-input {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 12px 16px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        background: var(--bg-main);
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        text-align: center;
        letter-spacing: 3px;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
        outline: none;
      }
      .auth-input-url {
        letter-spacing: normal;
        text-align: left;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      }
      .auth-input:focus { border-color: var(--accent-blue); }
      .auth-btn {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 12px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7, #2563eb);
        color: #fff;
        font-weight: 700;
        border: none;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: opacity 0.2s;
      }
      .auth-btn:hover { opacity: 0.9; }
      .auth-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.6; cursor: wait; }

      /* Command Center Layout */
      .app-layout {
        display: flex;
        min-height: 100vh;
      }
      .app-layout[hidden] {
        display: none;
      }

      /* Sidebar */
      .sidebar {
        width: 270px;
        background: var(--bg-card);
        border-right: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        transition: transform 0.3s ease;
      }
      .sidebar-header {
        padding: 20px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
      }
      .sidebar-brand { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; }
      .sidebar-brand span { color: var(--accent-blue); }
      .sidebar-nav {
        flex: 1;
        padding: 16px 12px;
        overflow-y: auto;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 4px;
      }
      .nav-btn {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        padding: 10px 14px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        background: transparent;
        border: none;
        cursor: pointer;
        width: 100%;
        text-align: left;
        transition: all 0.2s;
      }
      .nav-btn:hover { background: var(--bg-card-subtle); color: #fff; }
      .nav-btn.active {
        background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.12);
        color: var(--accent-blue);
        border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-blue);
      }
      .sidebar-footer {
        padding: 16px;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
      }

      /* Main Content */
      .main-viewport {
        flex: 1;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        min-width: 0;
        background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, #111a2e 0%, #080b11 60%);
      }

      /* Top Header */
      .top-navbar {
        height: 64px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 0 24px;
        background: rgba(15, 22, 35, 0.85);
        backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 50;
      }
      .header-title-box { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
      .menu-toggle-btn {
        display: none;
        background: none;
        border: none;
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        cursor: pointer;
      }
      .badge-ceo {
        background: rgba(255, 90, 54, 0.15);
        border: 1px solid var(--accent-orange);
        color: var(--accent-orange);
        padding: 4px 10px;
        border-radius: 9999px;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      }
      .header-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
      .btn-action-sm {
        padding: 8px 14px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        cursor: pointer;
        border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        background: var(--bg-card-subtle);
        color: #fff;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
      }
      .btn-action-sm:hover { border-color: var(--accent-blue); }
      .btn-action-primary {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7, #2563eb);
        border: none;
      }

      /* Content Area */
      .content-body {
        padding: 24px;
        flex: 1;
        overflow-y: auto;
      }

      .tab-section { display: none; }
      .tab-section.active { display: block; }

      /* Cards & Grids */
      .stat-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
        gap: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .stat-card {
        background: var(--bg-card);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 20px;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .stat-card::after {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 3px;
        background: var(--accent-blue);
      }
      .stat-card.green::after { background: var(--accent-green); }
      .stat-card.orange::after { background: var(--accent-orange); }
      .stat-card.amber::after { background: var(--accent-amber); }
      .stat-val { font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 8px 0 4px; color: #fff; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }
      .stat-label { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); }

      .card {
        background: var(--bg-card);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 24px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .card-header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        padding-bottom: 12px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      }
      .card-title { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }

      /* Command input box */
      .ceo-command-bar {
        display: flex;
        gap: 12px;
        background: var(--bg-card);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        padding: 12px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .ceo-command-bar input {
        flex: 1;
        background: transparent;
        border: none;
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        outline: none;
      }
      .ceo-command-bar button {
        background: var(--accent-blue);
        color: #080b11;
        font-weight: 700;
        border: none;
        padding: 8px 20px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      /* Tables */
      .data-table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        font-size: 0.88rem;
      }
      .data-table th, .data-table td {
        padding: 12px 14px;
        text-align: left;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      }
      .data-table th {
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-weight: 600;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      }
      .data-table tr:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); }

      .badge-status {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 3px 8px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .badge-status.completed { background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.15); color: var(--accent-green); }
      .badge-status.running { background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); color: var(--accent-blue); }
      .badge-status.pending { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15); color: var(--accent-amber); }
      .badge-status.failed { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15); color: var(--accent-red); }
      .badge-status.needs_approval { background: rgba(255, 90, 54, 0.2); color: var(--accent-orange); }

      pre.log-box {
        background: #05070c;
        border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 14px;
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: #a5b4fc;
        max-height: 260px;
        overflow-y: auto;
        white-space: pre-wrap;
      }

      /* AI Office Live Animation Styles */
      .office-toolbar {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        background: var(--bg-card);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 12px 16px;
      }
      .office-hud-pills {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
      }
      .hud-pill {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
        padding: 5px 11px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1);
        border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.28);
        color: #e2e8f0;
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      }
      .hud-pill .dot-live {
        width: 8px;
        height: 8px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--accent-green);
        box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--accent-green);
        animation: pulseLive 1.6s infinite;
      }
      @keyframes pulseLive {
        0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
        50% { opacity: 0.45; transform: scale(0.8); }
      }
      .office-controls {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 8px;
      }
      .office-btn {
        padding: 7px 12px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        background: var(--bg-card-subtle);
        color: #e2e8f0;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: all 0.18s ease;
      }
      .office-btn:hover, .office-btn.active {
        border-color: var(--accent-blue);
        background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.16);
        color: #fff;
      }
      .office-stage-wrap {
        position: relative;
        background: #070b14;
        border: 1px solid #1e293b;
        border-radius: 16px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55), inset 0 0 40px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.06);
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }
      #ai-office-canvas {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        height: 540px;
        cursor: pointer;
        touch-action: manipulation;
      }
      .office-bottom-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
        gap: 16px;
      }
      .office-feed {
        max-height: 220px;
        overflow-y: auto;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
      }
      .office-feed-item {
        padding: 8px 10px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8);
        border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-blue);
        color: #cbd5e1;
        line-height: 1.45;
      }
      .office-feed-item time {
        color: #64748b;
        margin-right: 8px;
      }
      .office-feed-item strong {
        color: #fff;
      }
      .inspector-meta {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }
      .inspector-avatar {
        width: 48px;
        height: 48px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.14);
        border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.35);
      }

      /* Mobile responsiveness */
      @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .sidebar {
          position: fixed;
          top: 0; bottom: 0; left: 0;
          z-index: 99;
          transform: translateX(-100%);
        }
        .sidebar.open { transform: translateX(0); }
        .menu-toggle-btn { display: block; }
        .office-bottom-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        #ai-office-canvas { height: 420px; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>

    <!-- CEO Login Gate -->
    <div id="auth-modal">
      <div class="auth-box">
        <div style="font-size: 2.6rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">🏢</div>
        <h2>Kantor AI — InfoLokerKita</h2>
        <p>Masuk dengan akun CEO untuk memantau animasi Kantor AI & pusat kendali perusahaan.</p>
        <form id="hq-login-form" novalidate>
          <label class="auth-label" for="hq-username-input">Username</label>
          <input
            type="text"
            id="hq-username-input"
            class="auth-input auth-input-url"
            placeholder="Masukkan username CEO"
            autocomplete="username"
            autofocus
          />
          <label class="auth-label" for="hq-password-input">Password</label>
          <input
            type="password"
            id="hq-password-input"
            class="auth-input"
            placeholder="••••••••••••"
            autocomplete="current-password"
          />
          <button id="hq-login-submit" class="auth-btn" type="submit">Masuk ke Kantor AI</button>
        </form>
        <p id="auth-err" style="color: var(--accent-red); font-size: 0.82rem; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0; display: none;"></p>
        <div style="margin-top: 18px;">
          <a href="/" style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none;">← Kembali ke Info Loker Kita</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="app-layout" id="hq-app" hidden>
      <!-- Sidebar Navigation -->
      <aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar">
        <div class="sidebar-header">
          <img src="/favicon.svg" alt="Logo" width="28" height="28" />
          <div class="sidebar-brand">AI <span>HQ</span></div>
        </div>
        <nav class="sidebar-nav">
          <button class="nav-btn active" data-tab="office">🏢 Kantor AI (Live)</button>
          <button class="nav-btn" data-tab="overview">📊 1. Overview</button>
          <button class="nav-btn" data-tab="employees">🤖 2. AI Employees</button>
          <button class="nav-btn" data-tab="recruitment">💼 3. Recruitment Dept</button>
          <button class="nav-btn" data-tab="newsroom">📰 4. Newsroom Dept</button>
          <button class="nav-btn" data-tab="seo">🔍 5. SEO Department</button>
          <button class="nav-btn" data-tab="design">🎨 6. Design Department</button>
          <button class="nav-btn" data-tab="data">🗄️ 7. Data Management</button>
          <button class="nav-btn" data-tab="marketing">📢 8. Marketing Dept</button>
          <button class="nav-btn" data-tab="auditor">🛡️ 9. AI Auditor</button>
          <button class="nav-btn" data-tab="tasks">📋 10. Task Management</button>
          <button class="nav-btn" data-tab="automation">⚡ 11. Automation Center</button>
          <button class="nav-btn" data-tab="financial">💰 12. Financial Reports</button>
          <button class="nav-btn" data-tab="settings">⚙️ 13. System Settings</button>
        </nav>
        <div class="sidebar-footer">
          <div>Website: <a href="/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent-blue); text-decoration: none;">infolokerkita.web.id ↗</a></div>
          <div style="margin-top: 4px;">Portal: <a href="/lowongan/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent-blue); text-decoration: none;">Lowongan</a> · <a href="/berita/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent-blue); text-decoration: none;">Berita</a></div>
        </div>
      </aside>

      <!-- Main Viewport -->
      <div class="main-viewport">
        <!-- Top Navbar -->
        <header class="top-navbar">
          <div class="header-title-box">
            <button class="menu-toggle-btn" id="menu-toggle" aria-label="Toggle menu">☰</button>
            <h1 id="page-title" style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700;">Kantor AI (Live)</h1>
            <span class="badge-ceo">● CEO: DANDIMAHESA</span>
          </div>
          <div class="header-actions">
            <button class="btn-action-sm btn-action-primary" id="btn-quick-report">📄 Laporan Harian</button>
            <button class="btn-action-sm" id="btn-logout" title="Keluar & Kunci Dashboard">🔒 Logout</button>
          </div>
        </header>

        <!-- Main Content Area -->
        <main class="content-body">

          <!-- 0. LIVE AI OFFICE 3D ROBLOX ANIMATION TAB -->
          <section id="tab-office" class="tab-section active">
            <div class="office-toolbar">
              <div class="office-hud-pills">
                <span class="hud-pill" id="office-mode-badge"><span class="dot-live"></span> STANDBY HEMAT TOKEN</span>
                <span class="hud-pill">💼 Loker Bonafit: <strong id="office-jobs-count">...</strong> <span style="color:#64748b;">(05:00 WIB)</span></span>
                <span class="hud-pill">📰 Berita Industri: <strong id="office-news-count">...</strong> <span style="color:#64748b;">(07:00 • 12:00 • 17:00 WIB)</span></span>
                <span class="hud-pill">🕒 <span id="office-clock">--:-- WIB</span></span>
              </div>
              <div class="office-controls">
                <button class="office-btn active" data-office-mode="auto">🕒 Sesuai Jadwal</button>
                <button class="office-btn" data-office-mode="0500">💼 Simulasi Loker</button>
                <button class="office-btn" data-office-mode="0700">📰 Simulasi Berita</button>
                <button class="office-btn" data-office-mode="0800">🛡️ Simulasi Audit</button>
                <button class="office-btn active" id="btn-cam-iso">🎥 Atas Belakang</button>
                <button class="office-btn" id="btn-cam-ceo">👑 Ruang CEO</button>
                <button class="office-btn" id="btn-cam-orbit">🔄 Auto-Putar</button>
                <button class="office-btn" id="btn-office-toggle">⏸ Jeda</button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="office-stage-wrap">
              <canvas id="ai-office-canvas" aria-label="Animasi 3D Kantor AI Karakter Roblox InfoLokerKita"></canvas>
              <div id="office-3d-hint" style="position:absolute; bottom:10px; left:12px; background:rgba(8,11,17,0.78); border:1px solid rgba(56,189,248,0.3); color:#cbd5e1; font-size:0.72rem; padding:5px 10px; border-radius:8px; pointer-events:none;">
                🕹️ Geser untuk putar 3D • Scroll/Zoom • Klik karakter Roblox untuk inspeksi
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="office-bottom-grid">
              <div class="card" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
                <div class="card-header" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
                  <div class="card-title">🤖 Inspektor Pegawai AI</div>
                  <span class="badge-status completed" id="inspector-status">BEKERJA</span>
                </div>
                <div class="inspector-meta">
                  <div class="inspector-avatar" id="inspector-avatar">🧠</div>
                  <div>
                    <div style="font-weight: 800; font-size: 1rem; color: #fff;" id="inspector-name">AI Manager</div>
                    <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--accent-blue);" id="inspector-role">Direktur Operasional (COO)</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 10px;" id="inspector-desc">
                  Mengkoordinasikan seluruh 8 divisi AI, memantau alur kurasi loker & redaksi berita, serta melaporkan ringkasan langsung kepada CEO Dandimahesa.
                </p>
                <div style="font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-muted); background: #05070c; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px;">
                  Tugas saat ini: <strong style="color: var(--accent-lime);" id="inspector-task">Memantau alur kerja seluruh divisi</strong>
                </div>
                <div style="margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
                  💡 Klik atau ketuk meja pegawai AI mana saja di denah kantor di atas untuk melihat detailnya.
                </div>
              </div>

